@startuml hr-screen-flow
title RMS - Screen Flow: HR Leader

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<Screen>> #E3F2FD
  BackgroundColor<<Popup>> #FFF3CD
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #E8EAF6
  BackgroundColor<<Error>> #FDE2E1
  BorderColor #1E3A5F
  FontColor #172033
}

state "Sign in\n/login" as Login <<Screen>>
state "HR dashboard\n/hr" as Dashboard <<Screen>>
state "Request queue\n/hr/requests" as RequestQueue <<Screen>>
state "Request review / suggested revision\nright drawer" as RequestDrawer <<Popup>>
state "Campaigns and overall plans\n/hr/campaigns" as Campaigns <<Screen>>
state "Create overall plan\nmodal" as CreatePlan <<Popup>>
state "Campaign detail + plan tasks\n/hr/campaigns/:requestId" as CampaignDetail <<Screen>>
state "Job posting workspace\n/hr/job-postings/:requestId" as JobPosting <<Screen>>
state "Task planner\n/hr/tasks" as Tasks <<Screen>>
state "Talent pool\n/hr/candidates" as TalentPool <<Screen>>
state "AI / hybrid candidate search\n/hr/search" as CandidateSearch <<Screen>>
state "Shortlisted candidates\nmodal" as ShortlistModal <<Popup>>
state "Candidate score evidence\nmodal" as CandidateDetail <<Popup>>
state "Latest CV\nnew browser tab" as CvPreview <<External>>
state "Interview scheduling + invitations\n/hr/interviews" as InterviewSchedule <<Screen>>
state "Google Calendar authorization\nexternal OAuth + /oauth2callback" as GoogleCalendar <<External>>
state "My panel calendar / attendance\n/hr/interview-detail" as InterviewDetail <<Screen>>
state "Completed interview evaluation\n/hr/results" as InterviewResults <<Screen>>
state "Pipeline and time-to-hire reports\n/hr/reports" as PipelineReports <<Screen>>
state "System notifications\n/hr/notifications" as Notifications <<Screen>>
state "Unauthorized\n/unauthorized" as Unauthorized <<Error>>

[*] --> Login
Login --> Dashboard : Login succeeds (HR_LEADER)\n[POST /api/v1/auth/login]
Login --> Unauthorized : Wrong role opens an HR route

Dashboard --> Dashboard : Load KPIs, tasks, plans and interview milestones\n[GET /api/v1/reports/hr-dashboard]
Dashboard --> RequestQueue : Sidebar: Request Queue
Dashboard --> Campaigns : Sidebar: Campaigns
Dashboard --> Tasks : Sidebar: Task Planner
Dashboard --> TalentPool : Sidebar: Talent Pool
Dashboard --> CandidateSearch : Sidebar: Candidate Search
Dashboard --> InterviewSchedule : Sidebar: Interview Schedule
Dashboard --> InterviewDetail : Sidebar: Interview Detail
Dashboard --> InterviewResults : Sidebar: Interview Results
Dashboard --> PipelineReports : Sidebar: Pipeline Reports
Dashboard --> Notifications : Sidebar: System Notifications

RequestQueue --> RequestQueue : Load review-only requests and summary\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/reports/hr-request-queue-summary]
RequestQueue --> RequestDrawer : Open request
RequestDrawer --> RequestDrawer : Claim unassigned request\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/assign]
RequestDrawer --> RequestQueue : Edit suggested values and return to Department Head\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id]\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/return-for-revision]
RequestDrawer --> RequestQueue : Forward owned request to Admin\n[PATCH /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:id/forward-to-admin]
RequestDrawer --> RequestQueue : Close drawer

Campaigns --> Campaigns : Load approved/request planning work\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/departments]
Campaigns --> CreatePlan : Create plan for an eligible DRAFT request
CreatePlan --> CampaignDetail : Save plan and open details\n[POST /api/v1/overall-plan]
Campaigns --> Campaigns : Submit / resubmit existing plan\n[PATCH /api/v1/overall-plan/:planId/submit]
Campaigns --> CampaignDetail : Open campaign

CampaignDetail --> CampaignDetail : Load request, plan, applications, schedules and posting\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests/:requestId]\n[GET /api/v1/overall-plan/by-request/:requestId]\n[GET /api/v1/applications?requestId=:requestId]\n[GET /api/v1/interviews/requests/:requestId/schedules]\n[GET /api/v1/job-postings]
CampaignDetail --> CampaignDetail : Assign HR member to task\n[PATCH /api/v1/task-plan/:taskId/assign-recruiter]
CampaignDetail --> CampaignDetail : Edit task duration / mark task complete\n[PATCH /api/v1/task-plan/:taskId]\n[PATCH /api/v1/task-plan/:taskId/status]
CampaignDetail --> CampaignDetail : Submit plan for Admin approval\n[PATCH /api/v1/overall-plan/:planId/submit]
CampaignDetail --> CampaignDetail : Start approved campaign\n[PATCH /api/v1/overall-plan/:planId/start-campaign]
CampaignDetail --> JobPosting : Open Job Posting Workspace
CampaignDetail --> CandidateSearch : Find candidates when CV task permits
CampaignDetail --> InterviewSchedule : Schedule candidate when interview task permits\n[?requestId=:id&candidateId=:candidateId]
CampaignDetail --> PipelineReports : Open reports

JobPosting --> JobPosting : Create or update inline posting form\n[POST /api/v1/job-postings]\n[PATCH /api/v1/job-postings/:postingId]
JobPosting --> JobPosting : Upload recruitment media\n[POST /api/v1/job-postings/media]
JobPosting --> JobPosting : Publish or close posting\n[POST /api/v1/job-postings/:postingId/publish|close]
JobPosting --> CampaignDetail : Back to campaign

Tasks --> Tasks : Load plan-generated tasks and update status\n[GET /api/v1/task-plan]\n[PATCH /api/v1/task-plan/:taskId/status]
Tasks --> JobPosting : Start JOB_POSTING task
Tasks --> TalentPool : Start CV_COLLECTION task
Tasks --> CandidateSearch : Start CV_SCREENING task
Tasks --> InterviewSchedule : Start INTERVIEW_COORDINATION task
Tasks --> CampaignDetail : Start HIRING task / view campaign

TalentPool --> TalentPool : Browse/filter profiles\n[GET /api/v1/candidate-profiles?pageSize=100]
TalentPool --> TalentPool : AI-rank against selected campaign\n[POST /api/v1/talent/search]
TalentPool --> TalentPool : Select candidate in inline detail pane
TalentPool --> TalentPool : Add candidate to permitted campaign\n[POST /api/v1/applications]

CandidateSearch --> CandidateSearch : Run campaign-member semantic search\n[POST /api/v1/talent/search]
CandidateSearch --> CandidateDetail : View score, skill coverage and explanation
CandidateDetail --> CandidateSearch : Close
CandidateSearch --> ShortlistModal : Show shortlisted candidates
ShortlistModal --> CandidateDetail : View candidate details
ShortlistModal --> CandidateSearch : Close / show all
CandidateSearch --> CandidateSearch : Shortlist, reject or reset screening status\n[POST /api/v1/talent/screening-decision]
CandidateSearch --> CandidateSearch : Record search interaction feedback\n[POST /api/v1/talent/feedback]
CandidateSearch --> CvPreview : Open latest CV\n[GET /api/v1/candidate/cvs/candidate/:candidateId/latest/file]
CvPreview --> CandidateSearch : Close browser tab
CandidateSearch --> InterviewSchedule : Schedule selected candidate\n[?requestId=:id&candidateId=:candidateId]

InterviewSchedule --> InterviewSchedule : Load campaigns, candidates, panels and existing schedules\n[GET /api/v1/recruitment-requests?limit=100]\n[GET /api/v1/applications?requestId=:requestId]\n[GET /api/v1/users/interviewers]\n[GET /api/v1/interviews/requests/:requestId/schedules]
InterviewSchedule --> InterviewSchedule : Create Google Meet / Calendar event\n[POST /api/v1/google-calendar/meet]
InterviewSchedule --> GoogleCalendar : Connect or reconnect Calendar\n[GET /api/v1/google-calendar/auth-url?returnTo=...]
GoogleCalendar --> InterviewSchedule : OAuth callback returns with\n?googleCalendar=connected
InterviewSchedule --> InterviewSchedule : Create schedule(s) and send invitation(s)\n[POST /api/v1/interviews/schedules]
InterviewSchedule --> InterviewSchedule : Handle candidate reschedule request and resend\n[PATCH /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:scheduleId/reschedule]

InterviewDetail --> InterviewDetail : Load active interview calendar\n[GET /api/v1/reports/realtime-tracking]\n[GET /api/v1/interviews/requests/:requestId/schedules]
InterviewDetail --> InterviewDetail : Accept panel attendance or mark absent\n[PATCH /api/v1/interviews/schedules/:scheduleId/interviewer-attendance]
InterviewDetail --> InterviewResults : Sidebar after interview completion

InterviewResults --> InterviewResults : Load completed list and selected details\n[GET /api/v1/hr/interview-results]\n[GET /api/v1/hr/interview-results/:id]
InterviewResults --> InterviewResults : Save own panel feedback\n[POST /api/v1/hr/interview-results/:id/my-feedback]
InterviewResults --> InterviewResults : Save evaluation draft\n[POST /api/v1/hr/interview-results/:id/evaluation-draft]
InterviewResults --> InterviewResults : Submit final recommendation\n[POST /api/v1/hr/interview-results/:id/final-recommendation]

PipelineReports --> PipelineReports : Load assigned requests, pipeline and time-to-hire\n[GET /api/v1/reports/pipeline]\n[GET /api/v1/reports/time-to-hire]
PipelineReports --> CampaignDetail : Open recommended action\n/hr/campaigns/:requestId?action=:action

Notifications --> Notifications : Load / mark notification resolved\n[GET /api/v1/notifications]\n[PATCH /api/v1/notifications/:id/read]
Notifications --> InterviewSchedule : InterviewSchedule notification
Notifications --> Tasks : TaskPlan notification
Notifications --> CampaignDetail : RecruitmentRequest notification
Notifications --> InterviewResults : OfferLetter / result notification

Dashboard --> Login : Sign out\n[POST /api/v1/auth/logout]

note bottom of Dashboard
  /dashboard redirects an HR_LEADER session to /hr.
end note

note bottom of InterviewResults
  HR records panel feedback and a final recommendation here.
  Final Hire / Reject and offer creation are performed on the
  Admin Interview Results screen, not in an HR offer modal.
end note

note bottom of Unauthorized
  Every /hr route in App.tsx is protected for HR_LEADER.
  Unauthenticated access goes to /login; wrong-role access goes
  to /unauthorized.
end note

@enduml
